  "query_preview": "/Tuesday through Saturday/...\nIssued 218 PM MDT SAT SEP 26 2026\nHigh pressure will remain aloft Tuesday through late week, \ncontinuing a warming trend with dry conditions area-wide. \nTemperatures will mainly hover near-normal on Tuesday, before \ngradually climbing 5 to 10 degrees above normal Wednesday \nthrough Thursday. Late Thursday through Friday, long-range \nguidances hint at a shortwave trough digging across the region. \nThere is considerable guidance uncertainty over its timing and \nbehavior as it passes our area. For now, a cooling trend and \nmostly dry conditions are expected Friday through Saturday.",
